    "/app/contacts and /app/templates \u2014 neither has ever been a route \u2014 and",
    "expected /app/admin to render under a token with is_platform_admin false,",
    "where a 404 is the correct answer. A harness is only as honest as its list,",
    "so tests/test_render_manifest_is_current.py checks every path against the",
    "filesystem and every expectation against middleware.ts's own gates."
