  "_redirects_note": "/app/settings, /app/branding and /app/billing are server redirect stubs (`redirect()` in a server component) left from the settings merge. They declare expectFinal so the harness proves they still land where they are supposed to, rather than reporting an 'execution context destroyed' race.",
  "_tokens_note": "Real ids from scripts/seed_test_accounts.py's personas, because the API verifies the signature AND scopes every query by account_id \u2014 a made-up id renders the same empty page as no token at all. The claim sets double as the middleware's gate inputs (is_platform_admin, account_type), so one table drives both the shell's role and the data it gets."
